.                 * 
.                 * Interpretation of Results:  
.                 * The coefficient on daughters_nr is the primary parameter of
>  interest. A positive 
.                 * and statistically significant estimate indicates that havin
> g more daughters is 
.                 * associated with stronger support for gender equality. Signi
> ficance is assessed at 
.                 * the 10%, 5%, and 1% levels, and z-statistics are reported. 
> Residual degrees of 
.                 * freedom are not applicable due to the maximum likelihood na
> ture of the logit model. 
